{
  "__comment": "File: shared/infrastructure/grafana/dashboards/test-comparison.json. Purpose: side-by-side p90/p95/p98 for k6 / performance runs. k6 remote-writes to Prometheus (see infrastructure README). Placeholder queries use k6_* names; they show No data until a run is exported.",
